      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "実は神威法王殿が、時折我々の目を盗んで\n神殿を抜け出し、どこかへ姿を消されるのです。\n行き先を突き止めていただけませんか？\nきっと目撃した者など居ることでしょう。",
        "official_en": "The Divine Sovereign occasionally slips out of the \ntemple without anyone noticing. I have no idea\nwhere he goes. Do you think you could find out?\nI'm sure someone has seen him.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
